Movies"},{"id":"tt34206385","imdb_id":"tt34206385","slug":"cinemana-3154649","type":"movie","name":"وقت الذروة | Primetime","poster":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt34206385/img","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt34206385/img","landscapePoster":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt34206385/img","description":"في إطار من التشويق والدراما، تدور الأحداث حول صحفي يتولى التحقيق في عالم الجريمة السفلي، لتكشف تحقيقاته العديد من الأسرار التي تغير التلفزيون إلى الأبد.\n\nIn 2006, To Catch a Predator host Chris Hansen sets out to make television history.","releaseInfo":"2026","imdbRating":"7.1","genres":["اكشن | Action","سيرة ذاتية | Biography","جريمة | Crime"]},{"id":"tt23112594","imdb_id":"tt23112594","slug":"cinemana-3148655","type":"series","name":"VisionQuest","poster":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt23112594/img","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt23112594/img","landscapePoster":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt23112594/img","description":"بعد إعادة تشغيله ونجاحه في الإفلات ممن سعوا لاستغلاله كسلاح، عاش \"فيجن\" متخفياً. وفي سعيه لإيجاد غاية جديدة لحياته، يستشير الشخصيات الذكية الاصطناعية المدمجة في برمجته، بما في ذلك \"فرايدي\" (F.R.I.D.A.Y.) و\"إديث\" (E.D.I.T.H.) و\"جارفس\" (J.A.R.V.I.D.)، وحتى \"ألترون\" سيئ السمعة. تنتهي حياة التخفي التي كان يعيشها حين تضعه مكافأة مالية رُصدت لمن يقبض عليه في رحلة هروب برفقة \"توماس شيبرد\"، وهو صبي غامض قد يكون التجسيد الجديد لابن \"فيجن\". وبينما يحاول \"فيجن\" تجنب الوقوع في الأسر، يتحتم عليه مواجهة حقيقة طبيعته، ومقاومة تأثير \"ألترون\"، وفك لغز رفيقه الصغير إذا ما أراد النجاة.\n\nVision, rebooted and having escaped from those who sought to weaponize him, has been in hiding. Searching for new meaning, he consults the AI personas embedded in his programming, including F.R.I.D.A.Y., E.D.I.T.H., J.A.R.V.I.S., and the infamous Ultron. His discreet existence ends when a bounty placed on his head thrusts him on the run with Thomas Shepherd, a mysterious boy who may be Vision's son, reincarnate. As Vision evades capture, he must confront his nature, resist Ultron's influence, and unravel the enigma that is his young companion if he's to survive.","releaseInfo":"2026","imdbRating":"8.3","genres":["اكشن | Action","مغامرة | Adventure","دراما | Drama"]},{"id":"tt38420997","imdb_id":"tt38420997","slug":"cinemana-3158777","type":"movie","name":"إنجيل عيد الميلاد | The Gospel of Christmas","poster":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt38420997/img","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt38420997/img","landscapePoster":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt38420997/img","description":"يواجه قسٌّ الشكوكَ وهو يحاول إنقاذ كنيسة عائلته الموروثة في منطقة مضطربة بمدينة نيويورك. ومن خلال الإيمان والصلاة، يُحارب شياطينه الداخلية وعدوه لحماية كنيسته وعائلته ومجتمعه قبل عيد الميلاد.\n\nA pastor faces doubt while trying to save his inherited family church in a troubled NYC area. Through faith and prayer, he fights inner demons and an enemy to protect his church, family, and community before Christmas.","releaseInfo":"2026","imdbRating":"5.4","genres":["عائلي | Family","دراما | Drama"]},{"id":"tt11540908","imdb_id":"tt11540908","slug":"cinemana-3145697","type":"series","name":"Carrie","poster":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt11540908/img","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt11540908/img","landscapePoster":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt11540908/img","description":"Carrie (2026) • دراما | Drama، رعب | Horror","releaseInfo":"2026","imdbRating":"7.6","genres":["دراما | Drama","رعب | Horror"]},{"id":"cine_1088972","slug":"cinemana-1088972","type":"series","name":"Sasaki to Pii-chan","poster":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/DAE153DD-E4AE-3BC5-236F-1EB10EAC1E45_poster.jpg","posterShape":"poster","backg